---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<div class="think-story" aria-label="How the THINK bottleneck changes with AI and Poesis">
  <div class="think-story__phases">
    <article class="think-phase" aria-labelledby="think-history-title">
      <header>
        <span class="think-phase__number">01 · Historically<br />The THINK pathology</span>
        <h3 id="think-history-title">THINK lived in people&rsquo;s heads and prose — BUILD and RUN moved at its speed or drifted.</h3>
      </header>
      <div class="think-phase__flow">
        <div class="think-capacity think-capacity--narrow">
          <strong>THINK</strong>
          <span>Implicit · manual · human-held</span>
        </div>
        <span class="think-phase__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <div class="think-capacity-group">
          <div class="think-capacity">
            <strong>BUILD</strong>
            <span>Human</span>
          </div>
          <div class="think-capacity">
            <strong>RUN</strong>
            <span>Human</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="think-phase__details">
        <li>Purpose, rules, and constraints scattered across people, meetings, documents, and tools.</li>
        <li>Every handoff reconstructed THINK — and lost a little of it each time.</li>
        <li>THINK artifacts went stale as BUILD and RUN changed — definition and reality drifted apart.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="think-phase think-phase--warning" aria-labelledby="think-ai-title">
      <header>
        <span class="think-phase__number">02 · Yesterday<br />Gen AI on pathological THINK</span>
        <h3 id="think-ai-title">AI generates probabilistically against implicit definitions — lose speed, or lose alignment.</h3>
      </header>
      <div class="think-phase__flow">
        <div class="think-capacity think-capacity--narrow">
          <strong>THINK</strong>
          <span>Implicit · manual · human-held</span>
        </div>
        <span class="think-phase__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <div class="think-capacity-group think-capacity-group--expanded">
          <div class="think-capacity">
            <strong>BUILD</strong>
            <span>AI-accelerated</span>
          </div>
          <div class="think-capacity">
            <strong>RUN</strong>
            <span>AI-accelerated</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="think-phase__details">
        <li>Keep the speed: every artifact drifts further from intent, compounding at machine pace.</li>
        <li>Restore alignment by hand: prompts, reviews, corrections, and controls consume the gain.</li>
        <li>Human attention becomes the control plane — understanding, validation, coordination, and accountability remain scarce.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="think-phase think-phase--poesis" aria-labelledby="think-poesis-title">
      <header>
        <span class="think-phase__number">03 · Today<br />The Poesis Gene Therapy</span>
        <h3 id="think-poesis-title">Human + AI capacity goes to THINK first — governance decides what becomes authoritative.</h3>
      </header>
      <div class="think-phase__flow">
        <div class="think-capacity think-capacity--governed">
          <strong>THINK</strong>
          <span>Explicit · AI-assisted · shared</span>
        </div>
        <span class="think-phase__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <div class="think-capacity-group think-capacity-group--expanded">
          <div class="think-capacity">
            <strong>BUILD</strong>
            <span>AI-accelerated or programmatic</span>
          </div>
          <div class="think-capacity">
            <strong>RUN</strong>
            <span>AI-accelerated or programmatic</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="think-phase__details">
        <li>AI sources and structures definitions upstream; humans govern what enters into effect.</li>
        <li>BUILD and RUN execute against governed definitions — traceable, with divergence surfaced immediately.</li>
        <li>Execution mode stays a choice: agentic today (SAF), increasingly deterministic and economic as the Operator (SIE) matures toward Organization as a Service.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </div>

  <section class="think-story__consequences" aria-labelledby="therapy-effects-title">
    <header class="think-consequence__intro">
      <span>Immediate therapy effects</span>
      <h3 id="therapy-effects-title">The organization becomes intelligible — to the people who run it and the machines that serve it.</h3>
      <p>Definitions stop being documentation. They become a structured causal context that can be reasoned over, simulated, and continuously evaluated.</p>
    </header>
    <ul class="think-consequence-list">
      <li>
        <span class="think-consequence__head"><span class="think-consequence__icon"><Icon name="grid" size={16} /></span><span class="think-consequence__step">Causal context</span></span>
        <strong>A structured model, not retrieved documents</strong>
        <p>Subjects, relations, and obligations are typed and machine-readable, so humans and AI reason from what systems <em>are</em>, what they <em>must</em> do, and <em>why</em>.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="think-consequence__head"><span class="think-consequence__icon"><Icon name="compass" size={16} /></span><span class="think-consequence__step">Analysis power</span></span>
        <strong>Impact traced before the decision</strong>
        <p>Changes ripple through typed relations, so blast radius, dependencies, and affected obligations are simulated from the model instead of guessed in a meeting.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="think-consequence__head"><span class="think-consequence__icon"><Icon name="check-badge" size={16} /></span><span class="think-consequence__step">Continuous evaluation</span></span>
        <strong>Drift reported as it appears</strong>
        <p>Norms are evaluated into deterministic verdicts against observed reality, so every divergence surfaces the moment it appears — not at audit time.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="think-consequence__head"><span class="think-consequence__icon"><Icon name="book-open" size={16} /></span><span class="think-consequence__step">Composed governance</span></span>
        <strong>Frameworks and regulations as one fabric</strong>
        <p>TOGAF, the ISO 25000 series, GDPR, NIS2 and more are attached from a catalogue and composed into a single enforceable fabric instead of separate lists.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="think-consequence__head"><span class="think-consequence__icon"><Icon name="spark" size={16} /></span><span class="think-consequence__step">Resource economy</span></span>
        <strong>The same resources deliver more</strong>
        <p>Intent stops being rebuilt at every handoff and deliverables derive from the model, releasing the human and compute capacity that drift consumes.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="think-consequence__head"><span class="think-consequence__icon"><Icon name="shield" size={16} /></span><span class="think-consequence__step">Governance by design</span></span>
        <strong>AI action stays inside the model</strong>
        <p>Directives and Norms bound what agentic and automated action may do, and every governed change stays traceable by construction.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</div>